{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026VmnRxqGbGG1794300155.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>《TVB邁向60年節目巡禮2027》今日（10日）於西九文化區戲曲中心隆重舉行，近百藝員盛裝出席，場面非常盛大。大會司儀由林盛斌、陳庭欣、鄧凱文擔任。</p><p></p><p>出席藝員包括：陳豪、陳展鵬、馬國明、譚俊彥、張振朗、袁偉豪、龔嘉欣、高海寧、羅子溢、張曦雯、陳煒、江美儀、劉穎鏇、蕭正楠、曹永廉、鄧智堅、陳曉華、何廣沛、洪永城、周嘉洛、朱敏瀚、阮浩棕、吳偉豪、張馳豪、陳浚霆、古佩玲、戴祖儀、劉倬昕、陳懿德、曾展望、葉蒨文、曹銦玲、羅毓儀、林俊其、馮熙燮、柯雨霏、甄敏芳、何沛珈、阮嘉敏、陳若思、郭珮文、俞可程、陳星妤、梁超怡、丘梓謙、姚宏遠、羅雪妍、李海銅、黃紫恩、黃婧靈、李芷晴、李尹嫣、黎寬怡、鄧伊婷、王汛文、曾錦燊、朱文慧、甘詠寧、邵展鵬、尹景順、許雲妮、鄭家聲、黃建東、施焯日、黃鍵豐、鍾晴、余宗遙、湯家琳、鄧美欣、黃泳嘉、袁絲珩、鄧匡閔、李澤欣、李澄晴、葉靖儀、胡敏芝、曾琬莎、李卓妍、夏晉軒、黃昇龍、張聞軒、卓彣義、MYNT（倪嘉雯、倪樂琳、莊子璇、盧映彤、喬美莎）等。</p><p><p><img alt=\"IG_SAM_7639.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026MGlst2MnSl1794307468.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"IG_SAM_7325 (1).jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026R5BE2D0kZT1794307474.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"IG_SAM_7556.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202633UQdKXFyR1794307481.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"IG_SAM_7488.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026JjL5uggG4Q1794307487.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"IG_WhatsApp Image 2026-11-10 at 16.32.06.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Uh2C0NQMaD1794300167.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"IG_WhatsApp Image 2026-11-10 at 16.34.39 (1).jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026cuEQAZtVcM1794300192.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"IG_WhatsApp Image 2026-11-10 at 16.32.08.